        "title": "Tingkauh kandih khou tei ai",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Tingkauh kandih khou tei ai lung khang,",
            "Chamdan khang poubaumei tat kan the;",
            "Jailou nimei ram khoutei lummei le nthanmei guai,",
            "Bumang than nun le lusuan na bamni.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Kauh kandih gailiangmei,",
            "Neilamei ram khou tei;",
            "Rianra rianriu mei mak,",
            "Mi bam khou tei neikhat tat puni.",
            "",
            "2. Akhang #!7na poubaumei thei lou,",
            "Apanti hei luai pui nung kiu mu;",
            "Rianra rianriumei nban khouhei #!7 ai tat tuanlana,",
            "Tingkaauh kandih akai thang tat puni.",
            "",
            "3. Kagan kathui apoubaumei #!7,",
            "Ata nduang louna tat bam me;",
            "Tingsangjang poubaumei le bam chamni kaidai khoutei,",
            "Jaojihmei #!7 ngammei nai dat lak khe.",
            "",
            "4. Tingkauh kaidai ai tang puinung kiu,",
            "Buh le neih #!7 ganmei nai lak khe;",
            "Chunsimei mikdui keimei, rianra rianriumei guaina,",
            "Khatsini mak ge tingkauh ram khou tei."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
